        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Hunt&#39;s</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">hypothesis</span> (H) and the related Getoor&#39;s conjecture is one of the most important problems in the basic theory of Markov processes. In this paper, we investigate the invariance of <span class="search-hit mathjax">Hunt&#39;s</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">hypothesis</span> (H) for Markov processes&hellip;
        <a class="is-size-7" style="white-space: nowrap;" onclick="document.getElementById('1903.00050v3-abstract-full').style.display = 'inline'; document.getElementById('1903.00050v3-abstract-short').style.display = 'none';">&#9661; More</a>
