    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        SN <span class="search-hit mathjax">Hunt</span> 248: a super-Eddington outburst from a massive cool hypergiant
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Mauerhan%2C+J+C">Jon C. Mauerhan</a>, 
      
